  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Elytra_Bombing/BH_EB_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">當玩家：</span></p><ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">正在使用鞘翅飛行；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">持有點燃道具（預設為「打火石」或「火焰彈」）；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">物品欄中至少有一個TNT；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">TNT道具無冷卻時間。</span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">按下滑鼠右鍵，就會在地面下方生成已點燃的TNT，轟炸地面💣！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Elytra_Bombing/BH_EB_banner1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#f60\">Forge</span> 1.9.X~最新版本（此處）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp;</strong></span>1.19.X~最新版本（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-bombing-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">Rift</span> 1.13.2（<a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/Elytra-Bombing/releases/tag/Rift-1.13.2-1.0.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#f90\">Bukkit / Spigot</span> 1.9.4~1.18.X（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/elytra-bombing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Elytra_Bombing/BH_EB_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">由 PwrDown 製作的影片：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Elytra Bombing（1分32秒）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/926tcazSPNY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">由 HELLDOG 製作的影片（西班牙語）：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9zZ2YgOmuuA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Elytra_Bombing/BH_EB_banner3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#000\">哪些項目可設定🔧？</span></p><ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#00f\">TNT 的引信時間；</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#008080\">轟炸冷卻時間；</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3cc;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">TNT 的<a style=\"color:#3cc\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fInertia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">慣性</a>。</span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Elytra_Bombing/BH_EB_banner4.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p><ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<strong><span style=\"color:#9c0\">絕對可以</span></strong>將此模組加入你的模組包中；</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">我<strong style=\"color:#396\">鼓勵</strong>你提出 Forge / Fabric <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.9 ~ 最新版本</span>的移植請求。</span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">想要和朋友展開軍備競賽，但厭倦繁雜的伺服器設定？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">聯繫 <strong><span style=\"color:#3cc\">BisectHosting</span></strong>，獲得一鍵設定的伺服器！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fTAPIO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Elytra_Bombing/BH_EB_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">點擊上方圖片，並使用優惠碼 <strong>TAPIO</strong>，即可享有首月 25% 折扣！</span></p>",
